{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-10","kind":"proposition","title":"线段中点的尺规作图","englishTitle":"To bisect a given finite straight line.","book":1,"number":10,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.10","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.10/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":10,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-10@raw-d85c03a0d9fc4929","contentId":"euclid-1-10","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d85c03a0d9fc4929890f93ef12931415cf4936814532afcf87ca9af793327e16","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-10.statement","euclid-1-10.construction.1","euclid-1-10.proof.1","euclid-1-10.construction.2","euclid-1-10.proof.2","euclid-1-10.proof.3","euclid-1-10.proof.4","euclid-1-10.conclusion","euclid-1-10.historical.1","euclid-1-10.historical.2","euclid-1-10.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-10.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-10","revisionId":"euclid-1-10@raw-d85c03a0d9fc4929","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9e004b84cc83c43fca1a35a8cfdaf8c00ea08122be123bad9027825a30e927df","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To bisect a given finite straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将给定的限定直线分成两部分。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一有界线，求两平分之。"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"一有界线，求平分之。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-10.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-10","revisionId":"euclid-1-10@raw-d85c03a0d9fc4929","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"596f8524bb25e51ea27733539d13967bdb5affba7efbda0b366a12f3470eee5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be the given finite straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB成为给定的限定直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-10.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-10","revisionId":"euclid-1-10@raw-d85c03a0d9fc4929","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f2a71fc1dc657bbf07316c018dffdee6c57917b7131ce2521a7db7daae3b151a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Thus it is required to bisect the finite straight line AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,必须把有限的直线线AB分成两部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-10.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-10","revisionId":"euclid-1-10@raw-d85c03a0d9fc4929","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"187614d9527ea8bccab94449aae31aa3e3cb3f25b893e1475e72b30609ee8a8a","citations":["euclid-1-1","euclid-1-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the equilateral triangle ABC be constructed on it, [[I. 1](/principles/euclid-1-1)] and let the angle ACB be bisected by the straight line CD; [[I. 9](/principles/euclid-1-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将等边三角形 ABC建在它上,将ACB角由CD直线两分为二; [[I. 1](/principles/euclid-1-1)] [[I. 9](/principles/euclid-1-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-10.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-10","revisionId":"euclid-1-10@raw-d85c03a0d9fc4929","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3fdb000fb861f5b0a16e8386825d64c032091e7776c1939d0d3ff642d63da68d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that the straight line AB has been bisected at the point D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,AB线线在D点被两分开。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-10.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-10","revisionId":"euclid-1-10@raw-d85c03a0d9fc4929","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c901aa88b1455dc77ba403f069f80a817f5f9bc9b083b28a7d36a41d018613fa","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since AC is equal to CB, and CD is common, the two sides AC, CD are equal to the two sides BC, CD respectively; and the angle ACD is equal to the angle BCD; therefore the base AD is equal to the base BD. [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为AC等于CB,CD是共同的,双方AC,CD等于BC,CD;ACD的角等于BCD;因此,底边,AD等于底边,BD。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-10.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-10","revisionId":"euclid-1-10@raw-d85c03a0d9fc4929","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"99fc918dfcf2898e60d88421bd7448d063105b728abe7ae442ff2906a1fa67b2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the given finite straight line AB has been bisected at D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,给定的限定直线AB线被两分为D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-10.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-10","revisionId":"euclid-1-10@raw-d85c03a0d9fc4929","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6e432e38b0000ec6ee99e2e8d764f4fbbb98aaaef6b326a175b8cd06205cc0c2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"所求作图完成。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-10.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-10","revisionId":"euclid-1-10@raw-d85c03a0d9fc4929","order":8,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c6a7d2d29c9cf10ba154409ac15d01d59604189e8a82b39a73820af2e0f32a5d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一有界线，求两平分之。"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"一有界线，求平分之。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-10.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-10","revisionId":"euclid-1-10@raw-d85c03a0d9fc4929","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0bf489d96d48a87f37a2b2611c43cf49ac86ce42c27d3e6acf6969cab1183df9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：丙丁乙、丙丁甲两三角形之丙乙、丙甲两腰等，而丙丁同线，甲丙丁与乙丙丁两角又等〈本篇九〉，则甲丁与乙丁两线必等〈本篇四〉。"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：丙丁乙、丙丁甲两三角形之丙乙、丙甲两腰等，而丙丁同线，甲丙丁与乙丙丁两角又等〈本篇九〉，则甲丁与乙丁两线必等〈本篇四〉。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-10.source","contentId":"euclid-1-10","revisionId":"euclid-1-10@raw-d85c03a0d9fc4929","order":10,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"86012b78e50d4824c3dd0dd4f67e2ae32d4072750af24a87810838633c30b4a4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / He